WEBVTT

00:01.130 --> 00:03.820
What do you think of Senior?

00:04.170 --> 00:07.330
I know this is like
an otaku-ish thing to say, but...

00:07.330 --> 00:09.570
He's like Master Ashford, isn't he?

00:09.570 --> 00:11.910
So you just mean you like him, right?!

00:12.800 --> 00:13.490
Huh?

00:14.960 --> 00:19.150
She went to an event
with Senior the other day.

00:19.710 --> 00:22.480
If Lilysa really likes Senior,

00:22.480 --> 00:24.420
she will take advantage of that.

00:25.310 --> 00:27.930
Senior, I...

00:28.350 --> 00:29.470
Lilysa...

00:31.130 --> 00:34.870
Nah, there is no way
Lilysa would do that.

00:34.870 --> 00:36.330
It's okay, Mikari!

00:36.330 --> 00:38.530
No matter what Lilysa does,

00:38.530 --> 00:41.120
I'm going to win Senior over
with my charm.

00:46.230 --> 00:47.220
All right.

00:48.170 --> 00:52.070
Senior, I came to visit~

01:20.390 --> 01:27.480
2.5 DIMENSIONAL SEDUCTION

02:27.000 --> 02:32.010
#6 SENIOR'S SECRET TRAINING?!

02:33.040 --> 02:35.430
Oh, it's Lilysa.

02:35.430 --> 02:37.330
You should at least lock the door.

02:37.330 --> 02:38.220
Mikari!

02:38.660 --> 02:40.430
Thank you for your help
the other day.

02:40.430 --> 02:42.330
I washed these clothes squeaky clean.

02:42.330 --> 02:43.910
Just put on your clothes!

02:43.910 --> 02:44.690
Y-Yes!

02:45.530 --> 02:47.020
How did it go?!

02:47.020 --> 02:49.790
Nothing happened between
you and Senior, did it?!

02:50.990 --> 02:53.360
The event was fun,

02:53.910 --> 02:58.280
but I've been thinking about it
ever since you asked me

02:58.280 --> 03:00.080
how I felt about Senior.

03:01.790 --> 03:04.800
I realized that I really like Senior
as a photographer

03:04.800 --> 03:06.800
who supports my cosplay

03:06.800 --> 03:09.000
and as a reliable friend!

03:09.000 --> 03:12.460
Heh, I see.
She's actually an idiot.

03:13.020 --> 03:14.950
This means they have made no progress.

03:14.950 --> 03:17.800
I'm glad that Senior is a senior
who falls in love with Liliel,

03:17.800 --> 03:19.800
but I'm also glad that Lilysa is an idiot.

03:20.300 --> 03:23.110
That means I still have a chance.

03:25.170 --> 03:26.830
So where's Senior?

03:26.830 --> 03:29.860
Oh, the 2nd year is going to be
a little late due to a test.

03:30.160 --> 03:34.280
And I figured I'd use this time
to change for today's shoot.

03:34.280 --> 03:35.820
I see.

03:35.820 --> 03:38.320
Lilysa Amano from Class 1-1!

03:38.320 --> 03:40.280
Please come to class ASAP!

03:40.570 --> 03:43.210
Oh, crap! I forgot I had
supplementary lessons!

03:43.210 --> 03:45.910
That's because you're sleeping
through the whole class.

03:46.230 --> 03:47.830
Mikari, my belongings!

03:48.170 --> 03:49.740
Could you look after my belongings?!

03:49.740 --> 03:50.420
What?

03:50.420 --> 03:51.730
Thank you very much!

03:51.730 --> 03:53.550
But I haven't said anything!

04:00.640 --> 04:02.770
I don't have that much free time.

04:06.600 --> 04:09.310
The classroom is so far
from the club room!

04:11.430 --> 04:13.400
Ah! Watch out!

04:15.630 --> 04:17.460
Ouch...

04:18.080 --> 04:18.570
Ah!

04:18.980 --> 04:20.960
I-I'm so sorry!

04:21.410 --> 04:24.850
Are you hurt?
You shouldn't run in the hallway.

04:24.850 --> 04:27.620
It's not a good look for a girl
to be covered in bruises, right?

04:27.620 --> 04:29.200
Y-Yes!

04:29.200 --> 04:31.230
I apologize.
Excuse me.

04:32.770 --> 04:36.300
S-She is a beautiful teacher!

04:40.800 --> 04:44.560
Sorry, Lilysa.
It took longer than I thought.

04:44.560 --> 04:45.470
What?!

04:45.470 --> 04:46.990
You got it wrong, Senior!

04:46.990 --> 04:50.670
I just wanted to understand more
about what you like,

04:50.670 --> 04:54.170
so I thought cosplaying as Liliel
would help me find out something!

04:55.340 --> 04:57.930
I-I thought that if I became Liliel,

04:57.930 --> 05:01.170
I would be able to get to know
you better, just like Lilysa.

05:01.170 --> 05:06.190
I'll take it off soon.
I know it doesn't suit me anyway.

05:08.230 --> 05:09.020
No...

05:09.670 --> 05:11.670
That's... Umm...

05:11.970 --> 05:13.230
It's working?!

05:13.230 --> 05:15.630
So if it's Liliel,
anything is fine?!

05:15.630 --> 05:18.600
No, but it's also proof that Senior
is just in love with Liliel

05:18.600 --> 05:21.840
and not in love with Lilysa!

05:21.840 --> 05:23.760
For now...!

05:24.170 --> 05:26.140
This is my chance!

05:26.140 --> 05:26.760
Here!

05:27.430 --> 05:29.800
Master Ashford~

05:33.610 --> 05:36.580
Liliel is hugging me!

05:36.580 --> 05:38.220
What is this?!

05:38.220 --> 05:40.300
I can't take it!

05:40.300 --> 05:43.740
M-My senses!

05:43.740 --> 05:45.620
Master Ashford...

05:45.620 --> 05:49.600
Today's Liliel is a little
different from usual.

05:51.260 --> 05:55.420
You can do whatever
you want with me.

05:55.830 --> 05:57.880
No way!

05:58.660 --> 05:59.590
Come on...

06:00.260 --> 06:01.300
Where...

06:02.040 --> 06:04.260
...would you like to touch me?

06:04.650 --> 06:08.220
I can touch her wherever I want?!

06:08.730 --> 06:10.510
How is it, Senior?

06:10.510 --> 06:13.190
You can't resist Liliel's seduction, can you?

06:14.020 --> 06:15.150
I...

06:15.690 --> 06:16.670
I can't...

06:17.590 --> 06:18.720
Why?

06:18.720 --> 06:21.010
Liliel is my waifu,

06:21.010 --> 06:23.250
but she is not mine.

06:23.250 --> 06:25.620
I cannot cross the line so lightly.

06:26.100 --> 06:27.810
So it's useless, huh?

06:29.420 --> 06:31.080
Well, it can't be helped.

06:31.440 --> 06:36.130
It was his dumb personality that made me
fall in love with him in the first place.

06:36.790 --> 06:37.840
I just wish...

06:38.230 --> 06:42.150
He felt the same way about me.

06:43.300 --> 06:47.010
Sorry I'm late.
We can start the...

06:49.520 --> 06:51.620
I-It's not what it looks like, Lilysa!

06:51.620 --> 06:53.910
Wait, Lilysa! I was just...

07:01.980 --> 07:04.530
This is the first time I've seen
Liliel with my own eyes!

07:04.530 --> 07:05.930
You're so cute! An angel!

07:05.930 --> 07:07.760
D-Don't make fun of me!

07:07.760 --> 07:09.910
I know it doesn't suit me.

07:09.910 --> 07:12.480
This is not Liliel at all.

07:12.480 --> 07:14.400
My breasts are not as big as hers...

07:14.400 --> 07:15.880
That's not true.

07:16.370 --> 07:20.410
Yes, I did say that you look good
when cosplaying Miriella,

07:20.410 --> 07:22.970
but that doesn't mean
that you can't do Liliel.

07:22.970 --> 07:25.060
You can be anything you want!

07:25.060 --> 07:28.340
The beauty of cosplay is that anyone
can be the character they want to be.

07:28.770 --> 07:30.510
Can be anything I want...

07:30.510 --> 07:32.360
I agree with Lilysa.

07:33.170 --> 07:36.770
There's no right or wrong in fan art, right?
It's okay if it's less than perfect.

07:37.340 --> 07:41.470
"I just want to share my love with everyone."

07:41.470 --> 07:43.500
It's the only way to find happiness.

07:45.000 --> 07:47.810
Lilysa... Senior...

07:48.840 --> 07:51.250
You two are too pure...

07:51.250 --> 07:52.950
FEELING BAD FOR COSPLAYING
WITH ULTERIOR MOTIVES

07:53.480 --> 07:56.960
Anyway, what panties did you pick?

07:58.100 --> 07:59.350
These look so real!

07:59.350 --> 08:00.940
'Cause they are!

08:00.940 --> 08:02.450
Can I take another look?!

08:02.450 --> 08:03.720
No! Please spare me!

08:03.720 --> 08:06.800
I'm never dressing as Liliel ever again!

08:09.990 --> 08:12.520
Okumura, over here!

08:12.520 --> 08:13.640
Mr. Ogino!

08:14.020 --> 08:16.500
I'll be in your care today.

08:16.500 --> 08:18.450
Sorry to contact you
on such short notice.

08:18.450 --> 08:19.350
Don't mind it.

08:19.920 --> 08:24.320
I was wondering if there was anything
I could do for the next event.

08:24.320 --> 08:26.820
So I want to learn
how to be a photographer.

08:26.820 --> 08:28.010
I see.

08:28.010 --> 08:30.600
You're a remarkable young man
who actively seeks mentorship

08:30.600 --> 08:32.910
from your senior.

08:32.910 --> 08:37.190
I guess you chose me because of my aura
of being a veteran of a hundred battles.

08:37.190 --> 08:38.790
You're flattering me!

08:38.790 --> 08:41.020
- Because you're the only one I knew...
- So it's my aura after all!

08:41.020 --> 08:42.610
But I can't tell him that...

08:42.610 --> 08:43.940
Okay, let's go.

08:45.080 --> 08:47.510
T-Thanks for having me.

08:48.490 --> 08:51.090
He's basically a nice guy.

08:52.720 --> 08:55.990
Since Lady Magino is cosplaying
a Japanese character, we rented this booth.

08:55.990 --> 08:56.970
Woah!

08:57.310 --> 09:01.380
If you use a perfectly suited background,
you can see the difference in your photo.

09:01.380 --> 09:02.920
A-Amazing!

09:02.920 --> 09:06.190
If you want to sell cosrom,
renting a themed background becomes a must.

09:06.920 --> 09:11.770
Cosplay is booming, so convenient studios
like this are popping up everywhere.

09:11.770 --> 09:14.340
On weekdays, they are even cheaper.

09:15.500 --> 09:18.730
Ogino, isn't the belt
in the back a little off?

09:18.730 --> 09:20.470
This costume is very well made,

09:20.470 --> 09:22.460
but once I put it on,
I can't fix it at all.

09:22.460 --> 09:24.120
Yes, my lady!

09:24.120 --> 09:28.130
It's Folosso, the courtesan!
It's another trending cosplay!

09:29.420 --> 09:32.280
Ah, Okumura.
Hello!

09:32.280 --> 09:33.340
Really glad to have you.

09:33.340 --> 09:36.210
S-Sorry for the intrusion!

09:36.210 --> 09:39.700
It's fine. It's exciting to have
a young face around here.

09:39.700 --> 09:42.170
But you're still a college student.

09:43.650 --> 09:45.650
Well then, let's get started!

09:45.960 --> 09:49.860
First of all, the basics of photography
are timing and focus.

09:50.200 --> 09:53.700
If you miss the pose
or the picture is out of focus,

09:53.700 --> 09:55.650
no amount of editing will fix that.

09:55.650 --> 10:00.120
I also recommend being
intentional about every shot.

10:00.120 --> 10:01.080
Intentional...

10:01.390 --> 10:04.040
Fitting the cosplayer
in the frame isn't enough.

10:04.530 --> 10:08.770
You must be aware of what each photo
is expressing and work to bring it out.

10:09.140 --> 10:12.840
The timing of the cosplayer's face,
what they want to show,

10:12.840 --> 10:17.470
and the timing of our shutter release
need to be perfectly aligned.

10:18.590 --> 10:19.460
Let's begin!

10:19.460 --> 10:20.410
Okay!

10:23.260 --> 10:27.580
First, try to take a picture with
the best timing in your own way.

10:27.580 --> 10:28.650
Y-Yes.

10:35.890 --> 10:37.370
Novice...

10:37.370 --> 10:38.410
NOVICE

10:39.010 --> 10:42.600
No, I asked him to teach me,
so I must stay calm!

10:42.970 --> 10:45.400
Compare this with my photo.

10:45.400 --> 10:46.130
Okay.

10:46.470 --> 10:47.460
Wow.

10:47.460 --> 10:51.000
Can you see that my timing is more perfect?

10:51.000 --> 10:53.090
It is not the same no matter who takes it.

10:53.420 --> 10:55.760
The photos were made
by a combination of people.

10:55.760 --> 10:57.180
Y-Yes!

10:59.180 --> 11:00.140
Okumura!

11:00.890 --> 11:03.320
Pay attention to her breathing!

11:03.320 --> 11:04.600
O-Okay!

11:05.210 --> 11:07.190
Think ahead to get that precision!

11:07.190 --> 11:09.570
Become one with your surroundings!

11:10.120 --> 11:11.530
Let me see.

11:11.530 --> 11:15.150
Oh, these look great!
Good work! You have good taste!

11:15.150 --> 11:17.690
Y-You're a quick learner, I see.

11:17.690 --> 11:20.400
Maybe my instruction was too good...

11:20.400 --> 11:22.290
Your photos are pretty close to Ogino's.

11:22.290 --> 11:22.650
What?!

11:22.650 --> 11:25.570
Ah, I want to use this photo in my cosrom,
so send it to me, okay?

11:25.570 --> 11:26.750
S-Sure!

11:27.480 --> 11:28.710
And now...

11:28.710 --> 11:31.730
Are you okay if I move on
to the sexy scene?

11:31.730 --> 11:32.560
What?

11:32.560 --> 11:34.530
I-I don't mind it,

11:34.530 --> 11:36.420
but on the other hand,
are you okay with it?

11:36.420 --> 11:39.050
I'm fine!
Just don't get nosebleeds, okay?

11:47.770 --> 11:49.190
What's wrong?

11:49.750 --> 11:54.210
I-I don't feel comfortable
taking photos like this...

11:54.210 --> 11:58.160
If I were in the opposite position,
I wouldn't like it...

11:58.740 --> 12:02.630
I don't understand
what you're saying, but...

12:02.970 --> 12:05.620
Cosplayers are happy
to be seen by others,

12:06.190 --> 12:08.350
and photographers are there
to support them.

12:08.350 --> 12:11.000
There's nothing to feel awkward about.

12:11.000 --> 12:12.710
Okumura, could it be...

12:13.260 --> 12:15.230
Do you have feelings for Liliel?

12:15.230 --> 12:17.050
Then it's complicated, isn't it?

12:17.370 --> 12:18.800
N-No! Of course not!

12:18.800 --> 12:21.760
I make it a priority
to keep things professional!

12:21.760 --> 12:24.990
I just don't know
why I think that!

12:27.290 --> 12:28.550
Then tell her!

12:28.550 --> 12:32.420
If you two are going to work together,
what you shouldn't do is hide how you feel!

12:32.420 --> 12:36.610
If something doesn't feel right,
be honest and tell the truth.

12:36.610 --> 12:38.700
That is the key to
a long-lasting relationship.

12:39.800 --> 12:41.160
O-Okay!

12:41.790 --> 12:44.080
I'm really sorry...

12:44.080 --> 12:46.370
We've just met, but I...

12:46.750 --> 12:48.870
Come on!
There's no stranger here, Okumura!

12:48.870 --> 12:51.080
This isn't even our first meeting!

12:51.670 --> 12:53.930
Being neighbors at an event

12:53.930 --> 12:56.770
means the same thing as being friends!

12:56.770 --> 12:57.470
Okay?

12:57.840 --> 12:59.860
I-Is it really okay?

12:59.860 --> 13:02.240
Don't worry about it, Okumura.

13:02.240 --> 13:04.680
I am thankful for that too.

13:04.680 --> 13:05.180
Huh?

13:05.840 --> 13:10.190
Lilie's cosplay stirred something
deep inside and changed me forever.

13:10.770 --> 13:13.890
We photographers always wonder,

13:14.280 --> 13:15.900
"Who's the next challenger?"

13:16.240 --> 13:17.410
The next challenger?

13:17.410 --> 13:19.680
You don't know about it?

13:20.680 --> 13:23.540
The four cosplayers
who rule the industry...

13:24.240 --> 13:25.700
The Four Heavenly Queens!

13:25.700 --> 13:27.660
Four Heavenly Queens?!

13:27.660 --> 13:32.010
She is a stoic, cool beauty who matches
her height and weight to the decimal point

13:32.010 --> 13:33.620
of her character at every event!

13:33.620 --> 13:35.130
Erika Awayuki!

13:35.910 --> 13:39.700
An absolutely adorable beauty,
backed by a large company,

13:39.700 --> 13:42.650
and said to have the best costume
and makeup in the world! Nagomi!

13:43.090 --> 13:45.530
A beauty with her kinky obsession
with pantyhose

13:45.530 --> 13:50.600
who has a large number of enthusiastic
followers due to go viral on social media!

13:50.600 --> 13:52.610
Yoki Hoshizuki!

13:53.060 --> 13:57.200
And a sexy beauty who has become
a legend with her overwhelming body

13:57.200 --> 14:01.030
and unrivaled love for her character! Mayura!

14:01.030 --> 14:04.430
These four cosplayers are
"the Four Heavenly Queens"!

14:05.990 --> 14:09.990
Well, there are definitely more than
five amazing cosplayers,

14:09.990 --> 14:13.730
but otakus prefer the Three Musketeers of Ramen
and the Four Heavenly Queens, right?

14:14.970 --> 14:17.670
Wait, but didn't Miss Mayura...

14:17.670 --> 14:21.010
Oh? So you've heard
the latest rumor too, huh?

14:21.420 --> 14:26.260
Miss Mayura has not appeared on the stage
since last year's Summer Comiket,

14:26.260 --> 14:28.470
and has stopped updating
her social media.

14:28.950 --> 14:32.440
The hottest topic in the cosplay
community right now is who is

14:32.440 --> 14:33.770
the next Four Heavenly Queens.

14:33.770 --> 14:35.940
Who will be Miss Mayura's successor?!

14:36.740 --> 14:38.400
Then, amidst all of this...

14:39.170 --> 14:41.460
...Liliel takes the stage.

14:41.460 --> 14:44.240
I felt the shock when I saw
Miss Mayura for the first time,

14:44.240 --> 14:47.910
and I am sure I was not the only one
who thought of that at that place.

14:48.300 --> 14:50.230
You mean Lilysa?

14:50.230 --> 14:51.120
That's why...

14:51.540 --> 14:55.590
That's why I'm helping you today,
despite our rivalry.

14:55.590 --> 14:59.670
It's no fun competing with
a rank amateur, after all.

15:00.860 --> 15:02.710
I...!

15:02.710 --> 15:06.370
I'll do everything in my power to help
Lady Magino become number one in the world!

15:06.370 --> 15:09.300
So, what say you, Okumura?!

15:13.200 --> 15:16.740
I don't intend to be at the top
or anything at all.

15:17.710 --> 15:18.480
But...

15:19.130 --> 15:23.440
If you say you'll take me there,
I guess I can't say no.

15:25.420 --> 15:27.980
A photo is made with a combination...

15:28.480 --> 15:30.990
Working together...

15:31.790 --> 15:33.450
Senior Okumura...

15:33.450 --> 15:35.500
Let's go, Lilysa.

15:36.640 --> 15:41.660
I didn't really feel comfortable being
called "partner" or "buddy."

15:42.090 --> 15:44.460
Lilysa is the only one who plays
the leading role.

15:44.980 --> 15:47.280
But I can't believe I was so naive.

15:47.280 --> 15:49.350
It's something we make together, isn't it?

15:50.950 --> 15:53.820
I promised to help her until the end.

15:54.730 --> 15:58.220
If that's what she wants,
I'm going to take her to be number one.

16:03.130 --> 16:05.630
Is Lilysa her real name?

16:05.630 --> 16:06.380
Ah!

16:06.380 --> 16:09.260
That's so cool.
It's like she was meant to be Liliel.

16:09.260 --> 16:10.530
Amazing.

16:10.530 --> 16:14.060
But don't worry.
Our lips are sealed.

16:14.060 --> 16:17.850
In return, make sure you two
come to the next event!

16:17.850 --> 16:19.080
We'll be waiting.

16:19.600 --> 16:20.550
Yes!

16:26.210 --> 16:26.550
So, today's agenda is

16:26.550 --> 16:28.310
THE 161TH MEETING OF STUDENT COUNCIL
So, today's agenda is

16:28.310 --> 16:30.470
VOTE ON PROMOTING THE AQUARIUM
to review the Aquarium Study Group's

16:30.470 --> 16:32.690
STUDY GROUP TO A CLUB
request to become a club.

16:32.690 --> 16:37.470
The club has six members.
Mr. Igarashi will be the advisor.

16:37.470 --> 16:39.560
They have experience
participating in contests

16:39.560 --> 16:42.270
and have no problem reporting
on the club's achievements.

16:42.660 --> 16:45.020
The club requirements are met, then.

16:45.020 --> 16:47.110
Any discussion?

16:47.110 --> 16:48.560
No.

16:48.560 --> 16:50.490
Yes? Please raise your hand.

16:50.490 --> 16:53.700
What about hygiene in the club's building?

16:53.700 --> 16:56.320
This has already been settled with a vote.

16:56.320 --> 16:59.960
So, let's review the notice
for the other club...

17:01.150 --> 17:03.170
Senior, what's this?!

17:03.630 --> 17:06.970
I had a chance to go out
to the city center last weekend.

17:06.970 --> 17:08.130
And grabbed some goodies.

17:08.130 --> 17:10.720
Can I take a look?!

17:10.720 --> 17:11.720
Of course.

17:12.800 --> 17:13.620
LILIEL VOL. 8

17:13.620 --> 17:15.930
LILIEL VOL. 8
But Senior, this one...

17:16.380 --> 17:19.500
Well, but this is a study in erotica.

17:19.500 --> 17:21.900
Then you are familiar with it, aren't you?

17:24.430 --> 17:26.460
Is this Ririmaru-sensei's new volume?!

17:26.460 --> 17:29.290
I really love her Liliel!

17:29.290 --> 17:31.320
I like how he draws her eyes!

17:31.320 --> 17:34.240
LILIEL'S PRESENT
But, Senior, are you really into sadism?

17:34.240 --> 17:35.910
LILIEL IN THE PRISON
Huh? Is that so?

17:35.910 --> 17:37.840
LILIEL'S TORMENT
I've never thought about it...

17:37.840 --> 17:40.700
LILIEL'S PRESENT
I do have a few volumes of the genre...

17:40.700 --> 17:42.190
LILIEL IN THE PRISON
When it comes to shonen manga,

17:42.190 --> 17:44.330
LILIEL IN THE PRISON
heroines are often victims.

17:44.330 --> 17:45.420
LILIEL'S TORMENT
But I never realized it...

17:45.420 --> 17:47.190
I know that.

17:47.190 --> 17:49.470
Even though it's for boys,
it's really deep.

17:49.470 --> 17:53.540
Ah, for me, I just relate
too much to the heroine.

17:53.540 --> 17:56.390
I guess I'm more of a masochist type.

17:56.390 --> 17:58.890
I guess that makes us
a perfect match, right?

17:58.890 --> 18:00.890
LILYSA
Perfect match?!

18:00.890 --> 18:02.350
S-SENIOR...
S-Senior...

18:02.350 --> 18:04.780
Don't think about it, you idiot!

18:06.560 --> 18:10.230
Anyway, the more the heroine is in a pinch,
the more erotic she becomes.

18:10.230 --> 18:12.150
So who's the sadistic type now?

18:12.150 --> 18:17.170
Also, there are many strong heroines
who can handle a pinch by themselves.

18:17.170 --> 18:19.240
I like that kind of girl, too.

18:19.670 --> 18:22.790
However, I like Liliel,

18:22.790 --> 18:28.130
so I admire it most when the heroine rushes
to rescue the protagonist in a pinch.

18:31.690 --> 18:34.570
Anyway, should we do a photo shoot?

18:34.570 --> 18:36.970
Ah, yes! And this time...

18:36.970 --> 18:39.950
Let's do a series of Liliel in distress!

18:41.810 --> 18:45.770
Master Ashford will definitely
come to my rescue...

18:46.110 --> 18:48.140
She's all fired up!

18:49.230 --> 18:52.110
Being intentional about every shot!

18:52.430 --> 18:55.630
So... Being intentional
about every shot, right?

18:55.630 --> 18:58.140
Since Liliel is being tied up...

18:58.140 --> 18:59.670
A downward angle might work best.

19:00.090 --> 19:01.540
Turn around and look at me.

19:16.740 --> 19:20.690
Senior, aren't you getting better
at taking pictures somehow?!

19:20.690 --> 19:22.140
Umm...

19:22.810 --> 19:24.640
Training? With Lady Magino and Mr. Ogino?!

19:25.020 --> 19:28.300
I learned a lot from them.

19:28.300 --> 19:30.110
Sorry for not telling you.

19:30.480 --> 19:32.830
You did that for me?

19:32.830 --> 19:36.360
Mr. Ogino says that cosplay
isn't something you do alone.

19:36.880 --> 19:39.930
This is something
that we must do together.

19:40.590 --> 19:44.310
I realized that if you want
to be famous for cosplay,

19:44.310 --> 19:46.270
I can't just tag along,

19:46.270 --> 19:48.780
but I have to really commit.

19:49.610 --> 19:50.790
What do you think?

19:52.310 --> 19:53.860
I...

19:53.860 --> 19:58.340
I just want to express my love
for Liliel through cosplay,

19:58.340 --> 20:01.990
so I'm not interested in being famous,
being Miss Mayura's successor,

20:01.990 --> 20:03.810
or anything like that.

20:04.140 --> 20:07.010
O-Okay, I see...

20:07.010 --> 20:08.060
But...

20:08.480 --> 20:11.430
Until now, I made costumes by myself

20:11.430 --> 20:13.280
and was satisfied with that.

20:14.150 --> 20:16.740
But when we went
to our first event together,

20:17.170 --> 20:20.780
many people were able to see my Liliel.

20:21.430 --> 20:24.220
Maybe I got a little greedy...

20:26.290 --> 20:29.990
Because I really had fun there!

20:29.990 --> 20:32.750
I had such a blast!

20:33.130 --> 20:35.970
I was surprised at how much fun
it was to be at a cosplay event,

20:35.970 --> 20:38.470
which I had always dreamed of.

20:38.870 --> 20:43.300
I wondered how much fun it would be
to cosplay in front of more people

20:43.300 --> 20:45.460
at a bigger event.

20:45.460 --> 20:46.930
In front of many people...

20:47.900 --> 20:51.460
If I could express my love
better to them...

20:52.670 --> 20:56.400
I really appreciate
your offer very much.

20:58.560 --> 21:01.110
Can I really ask you to do it?

21:01.450 --> 21:04.550
I promised to support you
every step of the way, right?

21:04.550 --> 21:06.450
And it's been really fun for me too.

21:07.070 --> 21:09.270
Let's explore what else
is out there together.

21:09.270 --> 21:10.320
Yes!

21:11.420 --> 21:11.930
MANGA CLUB

21:11.930 --> 21:14.860
MANGA CLUB
That photo studio was so cool!

21:14.860 --> 21:17.110
MANGA CLUB
A bit pricey though...

21:17.110 --> 21:20.130
Oh? I've never been to one.

21:20.480 --> 21:24.350
But we could set our own background
here in the clubroom.

21:24.350 --> 21:27.870
That's right.
Because this clubroom—

21:28.810 --> 21:31.390
This is the student council.
Is the club president inside?

21:32.090 --> 21:33.750
Student council?!

21:33.750 --> 21:35.320
Please unlock the door.

21:35.320 --> 21:39.690
Keeping the door locked
is against school rules.

21:39.690 --> 21:40.780
Liliel, hide!

21:40.780 --> 21:43.110
I-I'll be right there!

21:44.370 --> 21:45.330
Excuse us.

21:45.690 --> 21:47.790
How can I help you?

21:48.270 --> 21:50.250
We have a notice, so I'll be brief.

21:50.750 --> 21:54.080
Today, the Aquarium Study Group
has been promoted to a club.

21:54.080 --> 21:56.070
Huh? Aquarium?

21:56.070 --> 22:00.350
Then, Manga Club will be
demoted to a study club.

22:00.350 --> 22:02.450
D-Demoted?! Why so sudden?!

22:02.450 --> 22:03.840
According to our records,

22:03.840 --> 22:07.620
the Manga Club has not met the requirements
of a club for the past three years.

22:07.620 --> 22:11.640
This was overlooked while the club
building still had free rooms.

22:11.990 --> 22:14.100
Since three years ago?!

22:14.720 --> 22:17.140
You are the club president,
but you didn't know this?

22:17.140 --> 22:17.820
At any rate...

22:18.570 --> 22:22.160
We ask you to vacate this club room
to the new club.

23:55.000 --> 24:01.100
WE NEED AN ADVISOR
